(property "Description" " | design | Bourns MF-MSMF075/24-2 after Q304: Ihold 0.75 A / Itrip 1.50 A at 23 C; Ihold 0.60 A at 50 C and 0.49 A at 70 C (Bourns MF-MSMF REV. AO, p.1 and p.4). It limits the Noctua lead S27 (1x26 AWG) instead of F102 4 A; the flyback D305 and C318/C319 stay across the fan after the PTC (R-E3-17).; Reflow only: the maker forbids wave and hand soldering." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
