(property "Description" " | design | DBV SOT-23-6 per SLVS841G Table 5-1: 1 IN, 2 GND, 3 EN, 4 FAULT, 5 ILIM, 6 OUT. Latch-off -1 version from the parts DB entry of the E2/E5 channels.; EN = 3V3_Q6A keeps LC76G in the Q6A power domain: with Q6A off the module is unpowered, so the Q6A UART6 TX is never high into an unpowered module in normal states (R-E3-15).; A latch after a fault clears only by a 3V3_Q6A power cycle (Q6A reboot) or a LAB5 power cycle; FAULT_N goes to TP301 only, no MCP input is claimed." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
