(text "GNSS" (at 246.38 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8f519d11-20b3-5e54-a028-2a61baa83afc))
(rectangle (start 246.38 193.04) (end 383.54 226.06) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid e818609c-09f0-5301-9c32-d0976e605d0e))
(text "E3-08 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.2; §5.4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 247.65 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c31a33e8-2530-541e-8305-f55cc408b83b))
(text "Pico watchdog, MicroPython GPIO/UART adapter and host handshake implemented 20.10.2026 and tested on the host.\nActual GPIO timing, reset levels, WDT/brownout behavior and Linux/serial fault recovery have not been\nqualified on the device.\nВорота (стенд): Run the implemented firmware with the actual accepted Pico/Q6A assembly: scope MCP RESET\nassertion/release, safe output image including CHG_INHIBIT=1 after initialization, 100ms guard, 750ms\nheartbeat deadline plus measured latency, explicit fresh-session recovery, Linux kill/hang, UART\nloss/corruption, WDT/brownout and GPIO current/backfeed. Complete Pico power loss with Q6A alive remains\noutside Q306 coverage; no software test closes this boundary. GNSS branch (R-E3-15): measure the LC76G board\nsupply current on E3_GNSS5V (cold start, acquisition, active antenna) and set R396 to 1.5-2x the measured\ncurrent (start 162k, 144-192 mA); confirm U315 follows 3V3_Q6A (off with Q6A off) and record UART6_RX/TX\nlevels and LC76G VCC with LAB5 absent while Q6A runs and with U315 latched off after a short on E3_GNSS5V\n(S25) while Q6A runs (no back-feed through RXD above VCC + 0.3 V in either state); record which action clears\nthe latch (3V3_Q6A or LAB5 power cycle; whether a Q6A software reboot drops 3V3_Q6A)." (at 247.65 196.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8134886b-87e0-5a10-814a-c4d2494e9ba3))
(rectangle (start 246.38 228.6) (end 383.54 238.76) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 60 150 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid ca7cd3f4-2c9c-5f52-ab59-f5a65c9460a5))
(text "N-E3-02 — примітка — STACK §5.1 (правило RILIM); §8.1" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 247.65 229.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c3a7174c-fa57-5aad-86b5-ad91d978dd01))
(text "R396 = RILIM TBD (старт 162k 1%, 144–192 mA за рівняннями TI SLVS841G). STACK номіналу не задає, лише правило\nRILIM = 1.5–2× виміряного струму LC76G. Ворота: E3-08." (at 247.65 231.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 87939c84-c9bd-508e-b42a-9a691d15dfbd))
